{"id":"5fb6eea724c1b5f2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper.md","title":"计算有效免疫集的 c.e. oracle 必完全","display":"thm-effective-immune-ce-upper — 计算有效免疫集的 c.e. oracle 必完全","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper","aliases":["20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper"],"display":"thm-effective-immune-ce-upper — 计算有效免疫集的 c.e. oracle 必完全","chapter":"5","section":"5.4.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 5.4.6","source_printed_pages":[119],"source_pdf_pages":[154],"depends_on":["[[20-df-effective-immune]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]","[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-df-teq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-immune-ce-upper — 计算有效免疫集的 c.e. oracle 必完全"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.4.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>119</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" href=\"?note=b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" title=\"20-df-effective-immune\">20-df-effective-immune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1590e1a5b9442b9\" href=\"?note=d1590e1a5b9442b9\" title=\"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus\">20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{EffectivelyImmune}(B)\\)</span> 经全可计算界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TC\">\\(B\\le_TC\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_s\">\\(K_s\\)</span> 是固定有限枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)=\\mu s\\,[x\\in K_s]\">\\(\\theta(x)=\\mu s\\,[x\\in K_s]\\)</span> 为部分函数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" href=\"?note=b5b64991d8dc3e7d\" title=\"20-df-effective-immune\">20-df-effective-immune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d1590e1a5b9442b9\" href=\"?note=d1590e1a5b9442b9\" title=\"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus\">20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-immune-ce-upper}\\vdash C\\equiv_TK.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}effective-immune-ce-upper}\\vdash C\\equiv_TK.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(e)+1\">\\(b(e)+1\\)</span> 个不同成员，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(e)\">\\(F(e)\\)</span> 为这个有限集合的完整规范码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 无限保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 全定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\le_TC\">\\(F\\le_TC\\)</span>。c.e. oracle 近似模定理给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(e,s)\">\\(a(e,s)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\le_TC\">\\(m\\le_TC\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge m(e)\">\\(s\\ge m(e)\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{a(e,s)}=D_{F(e)}\">\\(D_{a(e,s)}=D_{F(e)}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>参数递归定理给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\)</span> 入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 时，程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)\">\\(h(x)\\)</span> 枚举有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{a(h(x),\\theta(x))}\">\\(D_{a(h(x),\\theta(x))}\\)</span>；未入时域为空。这里使用的是整个有限码，而非未保证长度的成员列表。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\\ge m(h(x))\">\\(\\theta(x)\\ge m(h(x))\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{h(x)}\">\\(W_{h(x)}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(h(x))+1\">\\(b(h(x))+1\\)</span> 个不同成员，违反界。因此所有入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)&lt;m(h(x))\">\\(\\theta(x)&lt;m(h(x))\\)</span>，所以</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\\iff x\\in K_{m(h(x))}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in K\\iff x\\in K_{m(h(x))}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 求右端有限界，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TC\">\\(K\\le_TC\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> c.e. 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\le_TK\">\\(C\\le_TK\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这完整实现原书“修改有效简单集完全性证明”的提示，适用于并非 c.e. 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；只有上界 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 需要 c.e.。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 119 / PDF 154。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-effective-immune","status":"resolved","id":"b5b64991d8dc3e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-effective-immune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus","status":"resolved","id":"d1590e1a5b9442b9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion-parameters","status":"resolved","id":"4f81acfa76416d15","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","locatio